<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni CZK 3.87 bln 9mo gross.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni CZK 3.87 bln 9mo gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for nine-month</p>
<p>period ending September 30, 1996, calculated according to Czech</p>
<p>accounting standards: (in billions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	 3.867    vs   6.825</p>
<p>Profit on financial</p>
<p>   operations		2.353    vs     2.028</p>
<p>Income from charges and</p>
<p>  commissions		3.114    vs     4.010</p>
<p> Interest income	  29.306    vs    24.821</p>
<p>Application of reserves</p>
<p>and provisions</p>
<p> for loans		   7.091    vs     0.482</p>
<p>Creation of reserves and</p>
<p>  provisions for loans	  4.281    vs    5.115</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Komercni Banka a.s., the country's largest commercial bank. Results are unaudited and calculated according to Czech accounting standards.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
